        "zh": {
          "title": "迦納空軍接收Dassault Falcon 6X公務機",
          "summary": "迦納空軍接收Falcon 6X公務機，該機11月16日抵達阿克拉國際機場（ACC）。",
          "body": [
            "迦納空軍接收一架Dassault Falcon 6X長程公務機，預定用於行政運輸。空軍表示，該機於2026年11月16日抵達阿克拉國際機場（ACC）。",
            "飛機抵達時獲得水門禮。國防部長Kenneth Gilbert Adjei、法國駐迦納大使Diarra Dimé Labille及迦納武裝部隊軍方高層出席迎接活動。",
            "迦納國會於2025年12月4日批准兩項採購協議。第一項是與Dassault Aviation的買賣協議，金額為$6,068萬，購買一架Falcon 6X。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Ghana Air Force takes delivery of Dassault Falcon 6X executive jet",
          "summary": "Ghana Air Force receives Falcon 6X jet, which arrived at Accra International Airport (ACC) on November 16.",
          "body": [
            "The Ghana Air Force has taken delivery of a Dassault Falcon 6X long-range business jet intended for executive transport. The aircraft arrived at Accra International Airport (ACC) on November 16, 2026, the service said.",
            "The jet received a water cannon salute on arrival. Defense Minister Kenneth Gilbert Adjei, French Ambassador to Ghana Diarra Dimé Labille and members of the Ghana Armed Forces’ military high command attended the reception.",
            "Ghana’s Parliament approved two procurement agreements on December 4, 2025. The first was a $60.68 million sale and purchase agreement with Dassault Aviation for one Falcon 6X."
          ]
        },
